			"notes": "## 0.2.3\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed server-thread blocking during coarse wind and weather synchronization after long-distance teleports (#19).\n- Wind sampling no longer creates terrain cells or waits for grid refreshes when cached data is unavailable.\n- Weather and meteorological map synchronization now reads snapshots published by the background simulation.\n- Large changes in player focus request an earlier background refresh. Wind and weather synchronization is deferred until destination data is available.\n- Reused weather packets within each dimension to reduce repeated work.\n\n### Added\n\n- Support for horizontally wrapping worlds (#20), including continuous coarse weather across seams, periodic planetary weather, and client-side field positioning.\n- Added AeroWorldWrapApi for integrations to configure a dimension’s horizontal period.\n\n### Validation\n\n- Builds passed for NeoForge 1.21.1, NeoForge 1.21.11, and Fabric 1.21.11.\n- Regression tests passed for concurrent reads, packet construction, terrain invalidation, teleport refresh requests, and wrapping-world seams."
		},
